{
  "id": "072",
  "title": "100 Thousand Yuan for 13 Letters",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-02-13",
  "synopsis": "An unusually short poem recently won first prize in a poem contest in Xianning City. Here you can read the poem for yourself.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/54/002a5d1982ebb70e0e46f7b4bb70e02a198be078.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "13个字10万元\n\n    “故乡真小/小得只盛得下/两个字”。\n    这是一首诗，13个字。这首诗获得了咸宁市诗歌大赛一等奖，奖金10万元。\n    有很多人感叹：“１个字差不多１万元，真是一字千金呀！”但是也有些人不太喜欢，说：“这个太短了，不能算是诗！”",
    "traditional": "13個字10萬元\n\n    “故鄉真小/小得只盛得下/兩個字”。\n    這是一首詩，13個字。這首詩獲得了咸寧市詩歌大賽一等獎，獎金10萬元。\n    有很多人感嘆：“１個字差不多１萬元，真是一字千金呀！”但是也有些人不太喜歡，說：“這個太短了，不能算是詩！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "100 Thousand Yuan for 13 Letters"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "“故乡真小/小得只盛得下/两个字”。",
      "traditional": "“故鄉真小/小得只盛得下/兩個字”。",
      "pinyin": "gù xiāng zhēn xiǎo xiǎo de zhǐ chéng de xià liǎng ge zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“My homeland is really tiny, so tiny it can only hold two letters.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "这是一首诗，13个字。",
      "traditional": "這是一首詩，13個字。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yì shǒu shī 2 ge zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这首诗获得了咸宁市诗歌大赛一等奖，奖金10万元。",
      "traditional": "這首詩獲得了咸寧市詩歌大賽一等獎，獎金10萬元。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shǒu shī huò dé le xián níng shì shī gē dà sài yī děng jiǎng jiǎng jīn 1 wàn yuán",
      "english": "This is a poem with only 13 characters."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This poem received the first prize at Xianning City's great poem contest, with a prize money of 100 thousand yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "有很多人感叹：“１个字差不多１万元，真是一字千金呀！”",
      "traditional": "有很多人感嘆：“１個字差不多１萬元，真是一字千金呀！”",
      "pinyin": "yǒu hěn duō rén gǎn tàn 1 ge zì chà bu duō 1 wàn yuán zhēn shì yí zì qiān jīn ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但是也有些人不太喜欢，说：“这个太短了，不能算是诗！”",
      "traditional": "但是也有些人不太喜歡，說：“這個太短了，不能算是詩！”",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì yě yǒu xiē rén bú tài xǐ huan shuō zhè ge tài duǎn le bù néng suàn shì shī",
      "english": "Some people lamented: “Almost 10 thousand yuan per character, it truly is one word worth a thousand in gold!”"
    }
  ],
